# Effective indices of the full and the shallow-etched slab, and the group index of their mean.
# Reference: root of the three-layer dispersion relation found with SciPy.
title 220 nm silicon slab, air cladding
stack core=0.22
materials clad=air
grating angle=10 etch=0.07
expect n_full 2.83088244 2e-07
expect n_etched 2.50489392 2e-07
expect n_grating 2.66788818 2e-07
expect group_index 3.64020719 0.0002
